{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41652","headline":"关山月 · 陈陶","name":"关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年嫖姚护羌月，今照嫖姚双鬓雪。\n青塚曾无尺寸归，锦书多记穷荒骨。\n百战金疮体沙碛，乡心一片悬秋碧。\n汉城应期破镜时，胡尘万里婵娟隔。\n度碛冲云朔风起，边笳欲晚生青珥。\n陇上横吹霜色刀，何年断得匈奴臂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}